        "Abstract": "SberQuAD is a large-scale reading comprehension dataset in Russian, created similarly to Stanford SQuAD. It contains about 50K training examples, 15K development examples, and 25K testing examples. The dataset was created by crowd workers who were asked to come up with questions that can be answered using solely the content of a given paragraph."
